# Conformance probe pack for the `cbor` wire (spec 0.28, ruling 23): an array
# at the top with a group at a position and a scalar after it, so a gap at the
# group's position shows whether a group's own path is walked into.
format        conformance-cbor-group
version       0.28.0
distribution  public
source        "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses          probe
wire          cbor

group    probe.nums   [0]
  field  probe.val    .          int
end
field    probe.s2     [1]        bytes
